OL,3,GNEWSAThe balancing act of police
OL,4,Apursuits and the rules around them
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince 29 October, three police pursuits
OL,7,Fin Leeds have ended in serious injury
OL,8,For death.
OL,10,FThree people have been killed and one
OL,11,Fperson has been left seriously injured
OL,12,Fin crashes caused by cars being
OL,13,Ffollowed by officers.
OL,15,FMost recently, Cameron Bell, 22, and
OL,16,FJade Langton, 23, both from York, died
OL,17,Fin a collision just before 01:00 GMT on
OL,18,FSunday. A man appeared in court over
OL,19,Fthe incident on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
